{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15899,\"date\":\"2026-07-01T11:12:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-01T09:12:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-creator-studio-pages-keynote-numbers-30-giugno-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple aggiorna Creator Studio, Pages, Keynote e Numbers\",\"excerpt\":\"Aggiornamenti in arrivo per Creator Studio con nuove funzioni AI e novità per Final Cut Pro, Logic Pro, Pages, Keynote e Numbers.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Creator-Studio-Apple.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"Creator-Studio-Apple.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15881,\"date\":\"2026-06-30T22:29:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-30T20:29:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-creator-studio-nuove-funzioni-ai-pixelmator-pro-final-cut-logic\",\"title\":\"Apple Creator Studio si aggiorna: nuove funzioni AI per Pixelmator Pro, Final Cut e Logic\",\"excerpt\":\"Aggiornamenti per Creator Studio Pro con nuove capacità AI: generazione immagini e forme vettoriali in Pixelmator Pro, sottotitoli automatici e strumenti di editing in Final Cut Pro, miglioramenti per Chord ID e sync in Logic Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-creator-studio-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-creator-studio\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15701,\"date\":\"2026-06-23T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-23T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-tvos-27-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la seconda beta di tvOS 27 agli sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito la seconda beta di tvOS 27 agli sviluppatori per i test. L’aggiornamento arriva due settimane dopo la prima beta e introduce novità su Podcasts, Control Center, AirPlay e accessibilità.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/tvOS-27-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"tvOS-27-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15583,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-siri-ai-pausa-non-e-una-persona\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Siri AI potrebbe ricordarti di fare una pausa e che non è una persona\",\"excerpt\":\"Nelle stringhe di codice della prima developer beta di iOS 27 compaiono riferimenti a un possibile “Take a Break Message” per interrompere conversazioni Siri AI molto lunghe e ridurre l’attaccamento parasociale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/New-Siri-Wave-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"New-Siri-Wave\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15512,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-taglia-frequenze-audio-keynote-wwdc-per-evitare-attivazioni-siri\",\"title\":\"Apple taglia frequenze audio nel keynote WWDC per evitare attivazioni di Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel keynote WWDC 2026 Apple avrebbe modificato l’audio ogni volta che viene pronunciato “Siri”, rimuovendo bande tra 3 kHz e 6 kHz per ridurre le attivazioni accidentali dei dispositivi vicini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/homepod-top-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"homepod-top\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15385,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T13:06:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-09T11:06:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-espande-visual-intelligence-split-conto-insight-nutrizionali-visionos\",\"title\":\"Apple potenzia Visual Intelligence: split del conto, insight nutrizionali e supporto a visionOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi aggiornamenti a Visual Intelligence: una modalità Siri nella Camera per riconoscere oggetti e suggerire azioni, con funzioni come split del conto e insight nutrizionali. La tecnologia arriva anche su visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/siri-mode-in-camera-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"siri-mode-in-camera\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15368,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T19:57:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-golden-gate-mac-compatibili-intel-fine-supporto\",\"title\":\"macOS Golden Gate: ecco i Mac compatibili e cosa cambia con Intel\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha presentato macOS Golden Gate al WWDC 2026. L’aggiornamento conferma la fine del supporto ai Mac Intel e indica quali modelli Apple silicon potranno installarlo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-Golden-Gate-Mac-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Golden-Gate-Mac\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15337,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T14:06:40+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T12:06:40+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ipados-27-quattro-novita-wwdc-safari-correttore-grammaticale\",\"title\":\"iPadOS 27: quattro novità in arrivo alla WWDC, da Safari al correttore grammaticale di sistema\",\"excerpt\":\"Alla WWDC si profila un iPadOS 27 con quattro novità: aggiornamenti per Safari, un correttore grammaticale di sistema e altre funzioni attese per migliorare produttività e scrittura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ipados-27--768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipados-27-\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15314,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:21+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-wishlist-wwdc-2026-siri-multitasking\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: la wishlist per WWDC 2026 (Siri, multitasking e altro)\",\"excerpt\":\"A pochi giorni dalla keynote WWDC 2026, l’attenzione si allarga anche a macOS 27: Siri, app dedicata, Liquid Glass, multitasking, supporto display esterni e gestione della memoria.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15312,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"novita-in-arrivo-con-macos-27\",\"title\":\"5+ novità in arrivo con macOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Tra redesign di Liquid Glass, un Siri più evoluto su Mac e aggiornamenti AI per Foto, Safari e Strumenti di scrittura: ecco le principali novità attese in macOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15271,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-5-1-fix-ricarica-iphone-air-iphone-17\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.5.1: fix per un problema di ricarica su iPhone Air e iPhone 17\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5.1, aggiornamento minore di iOS 26 disponibile via OTA. La patch risolve un problema di ricarica cablata su iPhone Air e su tutti i modelli iPhone 17.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.5.1-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5.1-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15142,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-siri-cambia-look-schema-scuro-e-app-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, Siri cambia look: schema scuro e app dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe ridisegnando Siri per iOS 27: interfaccia con colori scuri, app dedicata per chat e integrazione con Dynamic Island.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-2026-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-2026\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15128,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T11:30:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:35:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-funzioni-salute-watch-face-satelliti-rumor\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove funzioni tra salute, watch face e satelliti (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su watchOS 27: miglioramenti al tracciamento della frequenza cardiaca, nuove watch face e possibili funzioni satellitari. Focus anche su stabilità e performance.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15126,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T09:30:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:34:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-rumor-menu-airpods-siri-opzioni-airplay\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, i rumor su menu AirPods, Siri e opzioni AirPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi rumor su iOS 27: menu impostazioni AirPods riorganizzato, miglioramenti a Genmoji e Image Playground, nuove opzioni AirPlay e una nuova interfaccia Siri scura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15123,\"date\":\"2026-05-24T15:13:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-24T13:13:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prepara-genai-apple-com-in-vista-del-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara genai.apple.com in vista del WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Spunta il sottodominio genai.apple.com su DNS Apple, in anticipo sul WWDC 2026. Non risulta ancora collegato a una pagina attiva.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0